n-1567">SCP-CN-1567</a> | SCP-CN-1568 | <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1569">SCP-CN-1569</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-hunter" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3994327&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609467182" alt="Modern Hunter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3994327)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-hunter" >Modern Hunter</a></span></p> 
